6730:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_rcc_ex.c ****               (+++) Enables automatic calibration and frequency error counter feature
6731:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_rcc_ex.c ****            Note: When using USB LPM (Link Power Management) and the device is in Sleep mode, the
6732:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_rcc_ex.c ****            periodic USB SOF will not be generated by the host. No SYNC signal will therefore be
6733:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_rcc_ex.c ****            provided to the CRS to calibrate the HSI48 on the run. To guarantee the required clock
6734:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_rcc_ex.c ****            precision after waking up from Sleep mode, the LSE or reference clock on the GPIOs
6735:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_rcc_ex.c ****            should be used as SYNC signal.
